# C3-5 sec 1): one `param <name>=<value>` per default other than the
# module's own, `disable` to ship it off.  None: xsurf loads with its own
# defaults (intr=2).  Local settings belong in /etc/conf/modreg.local.d/xsurf,
# which no package owns.
